      "content": "The TPP was a massive failure that directly fueled the populist backlash by prioritizing corporate profits over American workers, as evidenced by the devastating job losses in manufacturing sectors. This agreement was a catastrophic mistake for national unity because it sacrificed the economic stability of millions of citizens for the benefit of multinational corporations. The resulting anger and distrust in institutions are clear proof that the TPP was a disastrous policy decision that deepened social divisions.",
