      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but i'm curious though, some people argue that the populist backlash wasn't just about trade, but more about cultural shifts and things like immigration or national identity. can we really say for sure that the TPP was the \"main catalyst,\" or is that just one way of looking at a really complicated situation?",
